<title>FRANCE: Fr. Telecom share capital 25 bln FFr - paper.</title>
<headline>Fr. Telecom share capital 25 bln FFr - paper.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The nominal share capital of France Telecom will be 25 billion francs, split up in one billion shares of 25 francs nominal, the Les Echos newspaper said citing the official decree establishing the company from January 1, 1997.</p>
</text>
